WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Fans: Let us go!

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Noura: A few more minutes - the station is clearing.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Noura: Sierra 2, Marshal 22. Fans frustrated at Gate 4 hold. Request update. Over.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Narrator: Noura stays put, tells the fans what she knows, and asks her supervisor for an update.

5
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.500
Narrator: Only the chain can end a hold.
